# Copy to .env.agent only when a coding-agent session needs a scoped credential.
# Keep this file minimal. Never copy the full .env, .env.local, .env.test, or production bundle.
# Prefer running secret-dependent app/test commands through npm scripts so the child process gets secrets, not the coding-agent process.
# Never add service-role/secret Supabase keys, database URLs/passwords, Cloudinary API secrets, deployment tokens, or production credentials here.
#
# Optional examples (leave commented unless a specific session requires one):
# GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
